<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 68, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>42 个接口，做成一页能读的目录</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', opacity: 0.72 }}>02 · Portal &amp; API</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 10, gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>结论先行　</span>入口不做成功能菜单，做成「你现在最可能要做的那件事」；开发者的入口，则是一份可检索、可试调的接口目录。
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 496, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>门户：先概览，再对话</Text>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 4 }} />
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 92, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 108 }}>概览三卡</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>知识库 · 文件 · 待办，各给一句「现在什么状态」，不让用户先跑一遍后台</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 92, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 108 }}>最近提问</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>点一条回到原会话继续追问，不新开会话——会话的连续性比「干净的新页」值钱</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 92, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 108 }}>自动建会话</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>判据只有一条：当前会话消息数为 0；追问、重试、点历史都不会新建</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 12, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>「新建会话」按钮被删掉了：用户要的是接着问，不是从零开始。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>接口面板：契约即界面</Text>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 12 }} />
                <Table
                    style={{ width: '100%', height: 300 }}
                    defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 16, textAlign: 'left', color: '#1A2230' }}
                    defaultCellStyle={{ border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' } } }}
                    cells={[
                        [
                            { text: '维度', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF', width: 120 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' }, border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#1E4FA8' } } } },
                            { text: '取值', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' }, border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#1E4FA8' } } } },
                        ],
                        [{ text: '数据源', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } }, { text: 'GET /api/openapi.json，代码即文档，不手抄' }],
                        [{ text: '规模', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } }, { text: '42 个路径 / 46 个操作 / 7 个分组' }],
                        [{ text: '布局', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } }, { text: '左目录 280 ｜ 右详情 854，两栏各自滚动' }],
                        [{ text: '错误三档', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } }, { text: '网络错→重试；401→重新登录；403→零按钮' }],
                        [{ text: '危险四档', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } }, { text: '4 个不可恢复 DELETE 需手输 DELETE 才执行' }],
                    ]}
                />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 12, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>深链 #admin/api?ep=GET:/kbs 可直接定位到一个接口；读取失败保留骨架，不白屏。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 50, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 8, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>企业内部技术支持知识库 · 课程作业汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>11 / 20</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
